    "lines": [
      {
        "scene": "hook",
        "text": "Casinos make money even on the nights you win. Here's how.",
        "start": 0.3,
        "seconds": 3.01,
        "window": 3.67,
        "fill": 0.82
      },
      {
        "scene": "promise",
        "text": "Follow one $10 bet. Three clues on this table explain it, and the last is why they love your lucky nights.",
        "start": 3.97,
        "seconds": 6.11,
        "window": 6.8,
        "fill": 0.899
      },
      {
        "scene": "green",
        "text": "Clue one is green. When the ball lands on a green zero, every red and black bet loses. That's the house edge: 5.26% of every bet, on average.",
        "start": 10.77,
        "seconds": 9.32,
        "window": 10.0,
        "fill": 0.932
      },
      {
        "scene": "time",
        "text": "Clue two is time. Nobody plays just one spin. Bet $10 a spin for an hour, and that edge adds up to about $20 for the house.",
        "start": 20.77,
        "seconds": 7.83,
        "window": 8.5,
        "fill": 0.921
      },
      {
        "scene": "shrug",
        "text": "Only $20 an hour? That's nothing. I'll have another drink.",
        "start": 29.27,
        "seconds": 3.38,
        "window": 3.83,
        "fill": 0.883
      },
      {
        "scene": "crowd",
        "text": "Clue three is the crowd. The casino takes that slice at every table, every night. Over a year of Saturdays, your slice alone comes to $5,197.",
        "start": 33.1,
        "seconds": 9.78,
        "window": 10.47,
        "fill": 0.934
      },
      {
        "scene": "turn",
        "text": "And your lucky nights? I love them. A win is the free drink that brings you back next Saturday.",
        "start": 43.57,
        "seconds": 4.96,
        "window": 5.63,
        "fill": 0.881
      },
      {
        "scene": "payoff",
        "text": "That's how the casino wins without luck: a small edge on every bet, and players who keep coming back. Ten years of Rohan's Saturdays come to $51,969.",
        "start": 49.2,
        "seconds": 9.99,
        "window": 10.67,
        "fill": 0.936
      },
      {
        "scene": "loop",
        "text": "Fine. But one more spin couldn't hurt, right?",
        "start": 59.87,
        "seconds": 2.01,
        "window": 2.43,
        "fill": 0.827
      }
